%description:
The configuration AntennaHeightRejected_OutsideStudyRange rejects, a base station antenna at
30 m in the TR 38.901 urban macrocell, runs when the channel model's tolerateHeightViolation is
set: the formulas are evaluated at the heights of the link, outside the study's range.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.gnb.cellularNic.antenna.mobility.offsetZ = 30m
**.nrChannelModel[*].tolerateHeightViolation = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 0
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Simulation time limit reached
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
